=== (c) sympy exact identities ===
Green-theorem area minus [r sqrt(d^2-r^2) + r^2 (pi - acos(r/d))] = 0
closed form at r=1/2 equals paper's f: True
f'(d) = sqrt(4*d**2 - 1)/(4*d)
f'(d) - (1/2) sqrt(1 - 1/(4 d^2)) simplifies to 0
f(1/2) = pi/4 = pi/4 = area(D)
support-function area formula minus f(d) = 0
